# bat config — pin the bundled Catppuccin Mocha theme so output (and ranger
# previews via scope.sh) matches the Ptyxis palette. Catppuccin's RGBs were
# chosen to clear contrast in BOTH normal and alt-i (RGB-negated) modes, so
# previews stay readable inverted — unlike bat's default 256-colour greys,
# which negate to a washy grey-on-cream.
--theme="Catppuccin Mocha"
